features.details:
collect_all_packages: deps of root (pkg 0) then deps of each Workspace package, BFS. Scannable = every resolution tag except Uninitialized/Root/Workspace (registry, git, github, local/remote tarball, folder, symlink...). Each entry: {name, version, requestedRange, tarball} as pretty JSON array ('[
  {
    "name": ...}
]'). npm: version=semver, tarball=dist URL with userinfo stripped but query KEPT (signed URLs). Others: version=resolution url fmt (Folder prefixed 'file:'), with userinfo AND query stripped (fragment kept); github: tarball = GitHub API tarball URL of resolved commit (or committish if unresolved), credentials stripped; Local/RemoteTarball: tarball=version; git+/folder: tarball "". requestedRange = dependency literal of last edge (credentials stripped), or version if none. Payload is written to child fd 4 (not argv/stdin; supports >1MB).
